# MASTER PROMPT FOR GOOGLE AI STUDIO — PREMIUM, RESPONSIVE E-COMMERCE WEBSITE

Act as a world-class UI/UX designer, senior frontend engineer, e-commerce conversion specialist, and full-stack web developer. Build a complete, professional, production-ready technology e-commerce website inspired by the visual style of the uploaded reference image.

The website must preserve the reference's premium aesthetic: a clean white interface, sophisticated dark-green branding, spacious layouts, rounded product imagery, elegant product cards, a large promotional hero, refined typography, subtle shadows, and a deep-green footer. Create a completely original brand identity, original marketing copy, original layouts where appropriate, and unique visual assets. Do not copy the reference brand name, logo, exact text, or proprietary identity.

The final result must look like a real online technology store designed by a professional agency for a paying client. It must be responsive, interactive, visually polished, accessible, fast-loading, and suitable for deployment on Hostinger.

## 1. PROJECT OBJECTIVE

Build a premium online electronics store selling products such as:

- Smartphones and mobile devices
- Laptops and computers
- Headphones, earbuds, and audio equipment
- Smartwatches and wearable technology
- Gaming controllers and accessories
- Chargers, cables, adapters, and other electronics accessories

Create an original brand named **Nexora Tech**. Use this brand consistently across the website, page metadata, navigation, footer, shopping cart, and other relevant components.

Brand personality:

- Modern, trustworthy, premium, innovative, approachable, and customer-focused.
- Visually sophisticated without feeling expensive or inaccessible.
- Minimalist European-inspired e-commerce design with a subtle technology aesthetic.
- Strong emphasis on product photography, clear prices, trustworthy service information, and conversion-focused shopping experiences.

Use French as the default website language to match the general language direction of the reference. Write polished, natural French marketing copy throughout the interface. Use Algerian dinars (DA) for the default product currency and clearly communicate delivery coverage in Algeria. Centralize language, currency, shipping, tax, and store settings so they can be changed easily later.

Do not build only a static screenshot. Create a functioning website with reusable components, working interactions, realistic product data, and complete shopping flows.

